ized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Kandivali West](/buy/mumbai/kandivali-west-1a256b7a71)\n\n>\n\nAnant Group\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/anant-group-anant-bhoomi-bedroom-1674905921.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/anant-group-anant-bhoomi-bedroom-1674905765.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/anant-group-anant-bhoomi-bedroom-1674905778.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/anant-group-anant-bhoomi-bedroom-1674905787.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/anant-group-anant-bhoomi-bedroom-1674905799.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/271221114439-anant.png)\n\n# Anant Bhoomi\n\nA-701, Sanjar Enclave, Opp PVR Milap Cinema, S.V. Road, Kandivali West. Mumbai 400 067 - India.\n\nKandivali West\n\n₹2.59 Cr - 3.3 Cr\n\n₹2.59 Cr - 3.3 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nAnant Bhoomi, An Uber-cool residential complex nestling amidst the peaceful green spaces & culturally rish locales of Mahavir Nagar Kandivali-West, Mumbai. It's close proximity to Link Road and S.V.ROad makes it easily accessible from both Western Express Highway and Railway Stations. With Schools, Colleges, Gardens, Malls, Clubs, Hospitals, Jain Derasars, Temples & other places of worship in close vicinity, thus living at Anant Bhoomi becomes a very pleasurable and hassle-free experience.\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Jun 2022\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹36,900/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n813 - 1012 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Modern Elevation and Immaculate Space Planning\n* Landscaped Garden and Recreation Area for Residents at podium Level\n* Fitness & Yoga Center Fully Loaded with Fitness Equipments\n* Only 3 Flats per Wing\n* 5.15% price appreciation in the last 1 year\n\n* Earthquake Resistant R.C.C. Structure\n* Elegant Entrance Lobby and Well-Decorated Corridors\n* Tallest Residential Tower in Mahavir Nagar\n* 3.04 m Vertical Landscape\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nGoogle reviews for Anant Bhoomi characterize the project as a premium high-rise in the heart of Mahavir Nagar. Residents and visitors frequently mention the impressive height of the tower and its status as a local landmark. The general sentiment is positive regarding the construction quality and the \"homely\" feel of the neighborhood. While the internal amenities and spacious floor plans are highly praised, feedback often highlights the external challenges of living in such a densely populated and active commercial hub.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nPrime Location\n\nSituated in Mahavir Nagar, offering immediate access to a famous \"foodie\" hub, supermarkets, and temples.\n\nConnectivity\n\nExcellent proximity to the Link Road and the Dahanukarwadi Metro Station (approx. 500m).\n\nSpacious Layouts\n\nMultiple reviewers highlight the \"huge\" carpet areas and well-ventilated, bright apartment designs compared to nearby projects.\n\nModern Amenities\n\nFeatures a club house, wellness center, gym, and rooftop facilities that are well-regarded by owners.\n\nReady Status\n\nThe project has received its Occupancy Certificate (OC), providing security for immediate possession.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nTraffic Congestion\n\nThe surrounding streets are noted for being extremely congested, especially during peak hours and evenings.\n\nNoise Pollution\n\nDue to the lively atmosphere and nearby commercial activity, noise levels can be high and disruptive for some residents.\n\nVisitor Parking\n\nWhile residents have allotted spaces, several reviews point out that parking for guests is very limited or inadequate.\n\nPopulation Density\n\nThe area is noted for being highly crowded, which can impact the overall peacefulness of the locality.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nBest for families who prioritize large living spaces and want to be in a vibrant, culturally rich neighborhood with everything within walking distance.\n\nIdeal for commuters who rely on the metro or need quick access to the Link Road.\n\nLess suitable for individuals seeking a quiet, secluded environment or those sensitive to heavy traffic and urban noise.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-secondary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-primary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-primary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK\n\n3 BHK\n\n* ## 813 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n2 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹2.59 Cr\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/anant-group-anant-bhoomi-2-bhk-bedroom-1674907229.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![hospital-primary](/assets/icons/hospital-primary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![school-secondary](/assets/icons/school-secondary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![bank-secondary](/assets/icons/bank-secondary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nTrident Multispeciality Hospital\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nOmkar Hospital\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nDr. Chirag Mehta'S Health Centre\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nNobel Hospital\n\n0.4 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nChavan Hospital, Dahanukarwadi\n\n0.4 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nUnited Multispeciality Hospital\n\n0.7 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹2,70,649per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹3,24,77,864\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nAnant Bhoomiis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800011600](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800011600)\n\nAnant Bhoomi\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Anant Bhoomi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Anant Bhoomi is 30 Jun 2022\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Anant Bhoomi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Anant Bhoomi is 813 - 1012 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Anant Bhoomi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Anant Bhoomi is ₹2.59 Cr - 3.3 Cr\n\n### Where is Anant Bhoomi located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nAnant Bhoomi is located at A-701, Sanjar Enclave, Opp PVR Milap Cinema, S.V. Road, Kandivali West. Mumbai 400 067 - India..\n\n### What configurations are available in Anant Bhoomi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nAnant Bhoomi has 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Anant Bhoomi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Anant Bhoomi is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Anant Bhoomi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Senior citizen Area, Swimming Pool, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Anant Bhoomi?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Anant Bhoomi is Anant Group.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Anant Bhoomi:Anant Group](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/271221114439-anant.png)\n\n## Anant Group\n\nWe believe design is where science and art break even. That's why we design homes in an environment that is both healthy and wise. We inspire an active lifestyle through our surroundings and uniquely designed homes. That's why we try to innovate concepts and create valued partnerships.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/je-vee-infrastructure-shree-gopaldham-elevation-1762949548.jpg)\n\n![Shree Gopaldham](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/240522105543-jeeandvee.png)\n\nShree G